  "{collegate} su {totale} collegate al listino generale. Le altre si caricano comunque, ma nei rapportini resta il prezzo generale finché non le colleghi.": "{collegate} of {totale} linked to the general price list. The others are uploaded anyway, but in the daily reports the general price stays until you link them.",
